==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*8 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.27 seconds<sup>2f~8f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Bookmarkers' Japanese name, Inti Raymi, is a reference to [[wikipedia:Naoto Inti Raymi|Naoto Inti Raymi]], the stage name of singer and songwriter Naoto Nakamura.

